{"id":"u-30556ee8-dbf9-4bb9-a714-22a4259294e6","src":"community","title":"6-Day PPL Hypertrophy","author":"irshath","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/oUgmuW-ppl-hypertrophy","desc":"A 12-week hypertrophy program run as a 6-day Pull / Push / Legs split, with each muscle group trained twice a week.\n\nSTRUCTURE\nDay 1 Pull A, Day 2 Push A, Day 3 Legs A, Day 4 Pull B, Day 5 Push B, Day 6 Legs B, then one rest day. The same weekly template repeats for all 12 weeks. A and B days use different exercises so you hit each muscle from more than one angle.\n\nHOW TO PROGRESS\nEvery set has a rep range (e.g. 8-10). Pick a weight you can lift for the bottom of the range with good form. When you can hit the top of the range on all sets, add a small amount of weight next session and work back up. Train most sets close to failure (around 1-2 reps left in the tank).\n\nREST\nRoughly 2-3 minutes on the big compound lifts (deadlift, squat, bench, overhead press, RDL) and 1-2 minutes on isolation exercises.\n\nWHO IT'S FOR\nLifters with some training experience who can recover from six sessions a week and want to focus on building muscle. Requires a full gym (barbell, dumbbells, cables and machines).","level":["Novice"],"goals":["Muscle"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":60,"joins":0,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-11-01T16:09:32.529Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Pull A","Push A","Legs A","Pull B","Push B","Legs B"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Deadlift (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":5,"hi":6,"x":3}]},{"n":"Pull-Up (Bodyweight)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Single Arm Row (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"x":3}]},{"n":"Face Pull","sets":[{"lo":12,"hi":20,"x":3}]},{"n":"Bicep Curl (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"x":3}]},{"n":"Preacher Curl (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":12,"hi":15,"x":2}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Incline Bench Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":12,"x":3}]},{"n":"Seated Overhead Press (Du